// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:231
//# NORMAL EXIT MODE:	RVQ
// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:232
//#		IF ELLIPSE, WITHIN NORMAL SCALING, RAPO IS CORRECT.
// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:233
//#		OTHERWISE, RAPO = POSMAX.
// PORT: SOURCE TIME_OF_FREE_FALL.agc:234
//# ALARMS:	NONE
